; Sprites: penknife (4 frames), teardrop with spot (4 frames)
;
; Eight 16x16 sprites of 32 bytes, 16 pixel rows of 2 bytes each (left byte, right byte; bit 7 = leftmost pixel). Sprite
; F of the page is at $AF00+32*F. Entity definitions (#R$A000) name the page in byte +5 and pick F from the animation
; phase, the direction and the slot data. The sprites are drawn with #R$9456 (#R$91BE) and have no colour of their own:
; ink and bright come from the entity definition. Frames 0-3 look like a penknife with a blade swinging open; frames 4-7
; look like a teardrop or leaf shape with a dotted spot, turning. Used by entity definitions $24 $27 $5E $62 in rooms
; $04 $07 $16 $22 $2A $33 $34.
@label=SpritesKnifeTeardrop
